{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_st01",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_st01",
  "title": "コード「ラマルク」",
  "storyCode": "OD-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a305e0407ae8f290bee731d24f8cc39d37f93867f298725448e4a786be8e9149",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_labcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……マグネットヒルNo.2内に入った。繰り返す。マグネットヒルNo.2内に入った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Iana？　Ela？　そちらの状況はどう？　オーバー。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "予定通り。間もなく最終段階を終える。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "オーバー。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ela？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Iana、戦闘準備！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "準備よし！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ジェミニ・レプリケーター起動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "GRZMOTマイン設置！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情報が正しいなら、これで最後のはず！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "こっちが終わりしだい、私たちもそちらに向かう！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gówno！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "オーバーアンドアウト！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情況はこんな感じよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後はポーランド人に任せとけば大丈夫だろうさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "GRZMOTマインの起爆音だな。あいつらなら大丈夫だろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ここからが本番よ。本気を出していこう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "メーターを見て。この建物の中には、密封された核廃棄物があるみたい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Frost、目標までの状況は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前方に検査ステーションと材料保管室。そこを抜ければ、主実験室がある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ドローンの映像だと、向こうは検査ステーションおよびその周辺に簡易的なバリケードを張っているだけみたい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遮蔽物が無い代わりに死角もない。入り口だけは塞がれてて、周辺に大量の有刺鉄線が張り巡らされてる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人数は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "判別可能なのが9人。おおよその位置は小隊の端末上にマーキングした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "検査ステーションから保管室に通じる出入り口は、完全に塞がれている。ドローンだけだとこれ以上は無理ね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "報告は以上よ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他に出入り口は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "見つからなかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "わかった。何とかする。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "LORDからは何かある？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "焼夷弾がまだ残ってるが、何発必要だ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二発。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "検査ステーションの入り口はかなり手の混んだ封鎖をされてる。無計画に爆破すればガレキが更に邪魔になる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "では計画を伝える。天井付近および右の壁を破壊後、一人がロープでよじ登って、上の穴から制圧射撃を行う。残りのメンバーは右の壁に開けた穴を突破口として突入する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Frost、制圧射撃および突入時の支援を任せる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ブリーチングチャージ起爆後、Tachanka、あんたは天井付近にできた穴へ焼夷弾を発射。他の者はマーキングの位置を狙ってスタングレネードを投擲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突入はBlitz、あたし、Tachankaの順番よ。行動は迅速に。隙を与えないように。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何か質問は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "よろしい。では、各員配置について。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Frost、あんたの合図で我々は行動を開始する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在、所定の位置へ移動中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ブリーチングチャージをセット。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "こっちも設置した。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行くわよ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "スタングレネード！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "焼夷弾もぶち込んだ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突入！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "順調よ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Blitz、2時の方向！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ファイアインザホール！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "10時の方向に機関銃手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前進しろ！　ここは俺が対応する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ブリーチング弾発射！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "バリケードの破壊に成功！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敵が倒れたぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あと3人いる！　正面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "残り2人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "状況、クリア！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "クリア！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "クリア！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "クリア！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "負傷者はいないか！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "よし、引き続き前進する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Frost、後方を警戒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あたしが扉を開ける。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Blitzは周辺を警戒。Tachankaはドローンで廊下と保管室の状況を確認。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "もうやってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "よし。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "この先の状況は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保管室は弾薬でいっぱいだ。奴らはしばらくここに駐在してたんだろうな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "材料室に敵はいない。いくつか黒い結晶があるのだけが見える。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "危険性は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "判断できない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "その瓶に入ってるのは何だ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "発光する鉱物結晶？　こんな光り方のは見たことが無いな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鉱石？　それとも合成化合物かしら？　発光するということは、放射性物質の可能性もあるんじゃない？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "その点は安心していい。ガイガーカウンターに反応はない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "なら進みましょう。その石は気にしなくていい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "それより、時間がない。急ぎましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ash？　こちらIana。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敵は片付けたけど、通路を塞がれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "核心部へは通路を変更して向かう。オーバー。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あたしたちは主実験室への突入準備中よ。合流はなるべく早めに頼むわ。オーバー。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解、オーバーアンドアウト。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "どうする？　他の連中を待つか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "いえ、時間がないわ。これ以上は遅らせられない。進みましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "これが主実験室の扉か。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最終確認後、突入する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全員、警戒を。ターゲットを見つけたら優先して制圧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能な限り短時間で。いいわね？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突入！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lab"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰もいないな……、変な機械があるだけだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警戒は継続。実験機材がまだ動いてる以上、ターゲットはこの部屋の近辺にいるはず。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "なら、まずは実験室に入ろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ここは実験室内の制御室だ。ガラスの向こうに機械が見えるな？　実際に実験を行っているのはあっち側だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "気を付けろ……敵の数は不明のままだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歓迎されざる客とは、いつも招いてもいないのに来るものだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（ターゲットらしき人物を発見。まだ撃たないで）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（周囲の状況を報告）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（他には誰もいない）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（こちらも他に敵らしき存在は見当たらない）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "手を上げなさい！　レヴィ博士、端末から離れて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一体、いつまで待てば会えるのかと心配していたよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "警備兵を倒してきたのかね？　それは非常に残念だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "昨日、彼らには給料を支払ったばかりだというのに。無駄金を使ってしまったな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "気を付けてくれ、ここは壊れ物だらけなのでな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勝手に動かないで。茶番は終わりよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終わり？　私の新たな実験はまだ始まったばかりだよ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動かないで……次の警告はない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ハハハハハッ……嫌だと言ったら？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "どうした、この老いぼれが怖いのかね？　武装すらしていない一般人だぞ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "武装はともかく『一般人』ではないな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "お前はマグネットヒルNo.2実験室の首席科学者、レヴィ・クリチコだ。そうだな？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "その装置に近付かないで。あんたが何をしたいかはわかってる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Blitz、彼に手錠を。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "実に素早い行動だ……感心するよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "だが、それでもまだ遅いな。もう間に合わない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原子炉が起動しただと！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黒い石が……光ってる！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "それを止めなさい！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "すまないが、それは無理な話だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "止めなさい！　今すぐ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ハハハッ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ハハハハ……ハハハハハッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あれはもう止まらない……さあ、存分に銃を撃つがいい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "私は一生をこの研究に捧げたのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "もし、あの先見の明がない無能どもが邪魔立てしなければ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "20年も前に、すべてが完成していたはずだった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あんた、自分が何をしているかわかってるの！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "この研究室の設備はひどく老朽化している。あんたは自分も巻き込んで核汚染災害を引き起こそうとしてるのよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ああ、自分がしていることなら当然わかっている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科学を探求する道は、可能性にあふれ、常に険しい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "しかし探求とは価値あるもの。真理の探求は絶対的価値を有し、なおかつ永遠のものなのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レヴィ",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "私はただ20年前に得られるはずだった成果を、今ようやく手にしようとしているにすぎない。もう、誰も私を止められない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_labcorridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "クソ野郎どもめ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "どうしたの？　大丈夫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ええ、大丈夫。ただ愚痴っただけよ。さっきは危うくやられるところだったわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本当なら他のオペレーターたちと一緒に主実験室に入ってたのに！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今からでも遅くはないわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "制御室は目の前よ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今の音は何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地震？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "違う……主実験室だわ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ジェミニ・レプリケーターの準備を！　きっと何かあったのよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cave_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "これは……どういうこと！？　みんなはどこ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "どうなってるわけ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "おかしい、実験室はどこなの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ela",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_161",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "マップは正しいわけ？　この巨大な空洞は何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "マップに誤りはないはずよ。この扉の向こうは実験室だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Iana",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_162",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "実験室が……消えた？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……きろ……はや……起きろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "コーエン？　大丈夫か？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "コーエン？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "私に任せて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "うぅ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "すごいな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ちょっと気付けのツボを押しただけよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "よし。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "な……何が起きたの……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "アレクサンドル、コーエンが目覚めたぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "よくやった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大丈夫？　コーエン？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ここはどこ？　……何があったの。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "いい質問だな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最初に何があったかだけど……レヴィが装置を起動した後、実験室全体が強烈な衝撃波に包まれた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "それで、ここは……どこなの？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あたしたちは今、どこにいるの！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "わからない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ターゲットが正体不明の実験装置を起動した結果、衝撃波が私たち全員を吹き飛んだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目が覚めた後に私が見た情況は、今あなたが見てる通り。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ElaとIanaには連絡がつかない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "コンパスも役に立たない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唯一確証を持って言えるのは、私たちが今いる場所は、任務エリア内ではないということ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正しい表現ではないと思うけど、私たちはまるで、制御室ごと一瞬にして……どこか別の場所に……転送されたみたい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "えっ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "その通り。まるで突然ロケットで月まで打ち上げられたみたいだ。これは冗談でもなんでもない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "私、偵察に行こうか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "いえ、軽率な行動は控えましょう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……了解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "もしターゲットも同じものに巻き込まれてるなら、彼もあたしたちと似たりよったりな状況のはず。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "まずは体力を回復して……その後、これからの行動を検討して計画する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "とりあえず良い知らせが一つ。あいつらの補給物資は俺たちと一緒に転送されている。しばらく弾薬の心配をする必要はない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "悪い知らせは？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "悪い知らせは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……今度は何の音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "気を付けろ！　壁の外に何かが近付いてきてる！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "音からして大型の工業製品のようだが……それにしては動きが速過ぎないか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確認する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……これは……自分の目が信じられない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*スラング*、面倒なことになりそうだ！　戦闘準備！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一体、何を見たってんだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "お前、乗用車並みにデカい節足動物ってのを見たことはあるか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "何言ってんだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "って……マジかよ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "さっきの質問はイエスだ。今見てるとこだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "撃て！！　早く！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Blitz！　後ろへ下がって！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "うわあああ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺の盾が！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "弾丸じゃ無理！　はじかれてる！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "この巨大なカニに壁を引き裂かれたら、もう終わりよ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "徹甲弾はダメージが入ってる！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "足を撃っても意味がなさそうだけどな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "だったら奴をこの部屋に入れて！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "なんだと！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攻撃止め！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奴に、壁に穴を開けさせて！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerId": "char_458_rfrost",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Blitz、大丈夫？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ああ、ケガはないが……装備が壊れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "くそっ、こんなにドでかい穴を開けやがって。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あとで甲羅を引き剥がしてやる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ash、計画は？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "計画とは言えるほどではじゃないが、今はこれしかない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今はあんたの徹甲弾だけがダメージを与えられる。それと恐らくあたしのブリーチング弾もね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "こっちは……残り1発。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "あのカニが壁を引き裂いた瞬間を狙う。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "このブリーチング弾ならあいつの足を吹き飛ばせる。ついでにひっくり返ってお腹をさらけ出したら、徹甲弾の出番よ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後はあんたに任せる。わかるわね？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "もっと良い提案があれば遠慮なく言って。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "じゃあ、話し合いは終わりよ。みんな、準備を！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "リロード！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "終わった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tachanka",
      "speakerId": "char_459_tachak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "こいつは一体……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "まあいいさ。とりあえずはこれで、ようやく一息つける。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "はぁ――ふぅ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "さっきはほんとに危なかったな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "ここは本当に……地球なのか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blitz",
      "speakerId": "char_457_blitz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "俺が言ってるのは、俺たちが知っているあの地球かってことだが。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今のところ、否定に足る理由は見当たらないわね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "だけど、最悪の事態に備えておく必要はある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "壁は完全に崩壊し、もう遮蔽物すら残ってない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ash",
      "speakerId": "char_456_ash",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "移動するしかないわね。体を休められる場所を探す。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
